8. Backend calls AI service /grade-assessment.\par
9. AI service returns score, outcome, feedback and report hash.\par
10. Backend stores result.\par
11. If PASS, backend creates metadata and certificate PDF.\par
12. Backend calls blockchain service.\par
13. Blockchain service signs and sends transaction to registry contract.\par
14. Registry mints NFT and emits certificate event.\par
15. Backend stores certificate token and transaction hash.\par
16. Frontend displays result.\par
